OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be a
OL,6,Fmostly cloudy evening with some
OL,7,Fshowers, perhaps heavy. Then becoming
OL,8,Fdrier in the early hours with just the
OL,9,Fodd shower in the west.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FIt will be a bright day with
OL,12,Fsome sunny intervals. A mainly dry
OL,13,Fmorning then a few heavy showers
OL,14,Fdeveloping in the afternoon. Fresh to
OL,15,Fstrong southwest winds.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FBright
OL,18,Fbut showery on Tuesday with strong
OL,19,Fwinds. Dry with some sunshine on
OL,20,FWednesday. Rain spreading from west on
OL,21,FThursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
